Bharadvāja invites Bharata to feast army --- Bharata pleads fear of harming āśrama --- Bharadvāja invokes Viśvakarman for hospitality --- Bharadvāja summons rivers wines foods and musicians --- Viśvakarman raises palaces halls and Rāma throne --- Bharata honors Rāma seat and sits as minister --- Pāyasa streams and sixty thousand women entertain soldiers --- Trees dance as musicians while beasts feast --- Drunken soldiers call it heaven refusing departure --- Dawn marvels vanish after wondrous night
